    <!--
      Simplified Chinese (zh-Hans). Machine translation, reviewed for consistency of
      terminology. Mainland conventions.

      Left untranslated on purpose: the app name, Shizuku, ADB and Obtainium (product
      names), the adb command itself, and WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS, which has to be typed
      exactly as written.

      setup_use_shizuku is matched as a substring inside setup_secure_settings_shizuku to
      bold it. Word it differently in the two places and nothing is bolded, silently.
      language_setup_subtitle names the Settings screen and its UI section, so it has to
      match how those are named in :feature:settings.
    -->
